nions with unique traits, backgrounds and goals. Whether you choose to help them achieve their ambitions or steer them toward your own objectives, your influence shapes their growth (or death), making them an integral part of the immersive story you create together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1449110/extras/8976f8f80d5dc1a5e6e2f6ab4b897770.poster.avif?t=1752520037\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1449110/extras/8976f8f80d5dc1a5e6e2f6ab4b897770.webm?t=1752520037\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1449110/extras/8976f8f80d5dc1a5e6e2f6ab4b897770.mp4?t=1752520037\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
